<br>
1.abbas ka parcham ho ke besheer ka ghula<br>
jo azmat e islam ka baqi tha assasa<br>
jalte huwe qaimo se utha legayi zainab<br>
<br>
2.naize ki anni aur wo akber ka kaleja<br>
wo qasam e noushah ka rouda huwa lasha<br>
maqtal se yeh manzar bhi utha legayi zainab<br>
<br>
3.gham aun o mohd ka liye saniye zehra<br>
ujhdi huwi har goud ko dede ke dilasa<br>
maqtal se kisi tarha mana legayi zainab<br>
<br>
4.jab chagayi har simth ujalo pe andhere<br>
teghoun se senaon se har ek zulm o sitam se<br>
abeid ko bachana tha bacha legayi zainab<br>
<br>
5.duron ke nasha dagh e rasan bhai ka kurta<br>
wo shaam ka darbar wo zindan ka andhera<br>
hum raha yeh saaman e aza legayi zainab<br>
<br>
6.yeh gham hai fareed aaj bhi zainab ki amanat<br>
jo seh ke har ek gaam musibat pe musibat<br>
shabbir ke maqsad ko bacha legayi zainab